<PageTitle>Accordion — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Accordion</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    One <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> per item, so it opens and closes with no JavaScript at all and survives a fragment swap without a compiler. Give every item the same <code>Name</code> and the browser closes the others for you — that is shadcn's <code>type="single"</code>, written as an attribute.
</p>

